This confirms the three stub functions are GCC startup artifacts:
- `FUN_00400510` = `deregister_tm_clones` (called from `.eh_frame_hdr` at 0x40140c/0x40144c)
- `FUN_00400520` = `register_tm_clones`
- `FUN_00400550` = frame_dummy / `__do_global_dtors_aux`

They are compiler init/shutdown code, not part of the program, and are not referenced by `main`. Only `FUN_004003f0` (main) is the real program code.

